{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28067","headline":"山泉 · 杨发","name":"山泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"半空飞下水，势去响如雷。\n静彻啼猨寺，高陵坐客台。\n耳同经劒阁，身若到天台。\n溅树吹成冻，邻祠触作灰。\n深中试榔栗，浅处落莓苔。\n半夜重城闭，潺湲枕底来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨发","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28067.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28067","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}